WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.075
The dangers.

2
00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:05.275
Member-of in a rule after November
third quietly stops removal;

3
00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:07.213
the lint and the scan catch it.

4
00:00:07.213 --> 00:00:10.063
Two policies a user can match lose access.

5
00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:13.649
A rule on a display name
drops everyone on a rename.

6
00:00:13.649 --> 00:00:18.925
A policy that never removes, or a long
grace, lets access outlive the move.

7
00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:22.037
Privileged access by rule
is standing privilege.

8
00:00:22.037 --> 00:00:24.779
Hand-granted access on
a mover stays forever,

9
00:00:24.779 --> 00:00:27.150
which is what the residual sheet is for.

10
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.800
Never edit the hidden group.

11
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.070
And a rule the evaluator can't read
raises an error instead of pretending.
